        "description": {
            "value": "<p>Each creature in a 60-foot line takes @Damage[2d6[electricity]] damage with a basic Reflex save. Creatures that fail are <strong>stunned 1</strong>; creatures that critically fail are <strong>stunned 2</strong>.</p><hr /><p><strong>Heightened (+1)</strong> The damage increases by 1d6.</p><p><strong>Refined (9th)</strong> You may instead throw <strong>Galvano Javelin</strong>.</p><hr /><p><em>This carries the <strong>incapacitation</strong> trait. Stunned on a failed basic save at rank 1 is above the curve without it; against a creature of higher level than you it will usually do nothing but damage, and that is the intended shape.</em></p>"
